#: assets/js/src/07_video_volume_control.js:68
msgid ""
"Click on this button to mute or unmute this video or press UP or DOWN "
"buttons to increase or decrease volume level."
msgstr "按一下此按鈕可將該影片靜音或取消靜音，或按向上或向下按鈕可增加或減少音量。"

#: assets/js/src/07_video_volume_control.js:69
msgid "Adjust video volume"
msgstr "調整影片音量"

#: assets/js/src/08_video_speed_control.js:33
msgid ""
"Press UP to enter the speed menu then use the UP and DOWN arrow keys to "
"navigate the different speeds, then press ENTER to change to the selected "
"speed."
msgstr "按下向上鍵開啟速度選單，再按上下方向鍵選擇速度，然後按回車鍵切換到選定速度。"

#: assets/js/src/08_video_speed_control.js:37
msgid "Adjust video speed"
msgstr "調整影片速度"

#: assets/js/src/08_video_speed_control.js:268
msgid "Video speed: "
msgstr "影片速度： "

#: assets/js/src/09_play_skip_control.js:77
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "跳過"

#: assets/js/src/09_skip_control.js:31
msgid "Do not show again"
msgstr "不再顯示"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:105
msgid "Open language menu"
msgstr "開啟語言選單"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:628
msgid "Transcript will be displayed when you start playing the video."
msgstr "當您開始播放影片時，將顯示字幕。"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:876
msgid ""
"Activating a link in this group will skip to the corresponding point in the "
"video."
msgstr "啟動該組中的連結將跳至影片中的對應點。"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:879
msgid "Video transcript"
msgstr "影片字幕"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:882
msgid "Start of transcript. Skip to the end."
msgstr "字幕的開始。跳到最後。"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:886
msgid "End of transcript. Skip to the start."
msgstr "字幕結束。跳到開頭。"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:890
msgid ""
"Press the UP arrow key to enter the language menu then use UP and DOWN arrow"
" keys to navigate language options. Press ENTER to change to the selected "
"language."
msgstr "按下向上鍵開啟語言功能選單，然後使用上下方向鍵選擇語言選項。按下回車鍵以切換到所選的語言。"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:1246
msgid "Hide closed captions"
msgstr "隱藏CC字幕"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:1264
msgid "(Caption will be displayed when you start playing the video.)"
msgstr "（開始播放影片時將顯示字幕。）"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:1271
msgid "Turn on closed captioning"
msgstr "開啟CC字幕"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:1379
msgid "Turn on transcripts"
msgstr "打開字幕"

#: assets/js/src/09_video_caption.js:1394
msgid "Turn off transcripts"
msgstr "關閉字幕"
